    "detailed_description": "The Moon Relax is a realistic exploration and survival game set in a large open world on the Moon. The game is an experiment with unusual mechanics that you have not seen before, with an emphasis on realism.<br>To survive, you have a long way to go: transport goods, explore the territory, grow vegetables, craft various items, create cargo, mine ores.<br>For example, overdoing it with radiation drugs, the main character can get hallucinations. Also, do not underestimate lunar gravity, it can play into your hands or against you.<br>Great soundtrack, and the atmosphere of the game will help you relax a little. A lot of surprises await you.<br><br><strong>Are you ready for a challenge in a new unusual universe?</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> FEATURES: <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br>\u2022 Survival on the Moon.<br>\u2022 Ability to control the lunar rover.<br>\u2022 Ability to control the drone.<br>\u2022 Craft.<br>\u2022 Explore the skill tree.<br>\u2022 Exploration of a large open area.<br>\u2022 Realistic graphics.<br>\u2022 Mining.<br>\u2022 Excellent soundtrack.<br>\u2022 Atmosphere.<br>\u2022 Transportation of goods.<br>\u2022 The force of gravity.<br>\u2022 Scoring.</h2></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "The Moon Relax is a realistic exploration and survival game set in a large open world on the Moon. The game is an experiment with unusual mechanics that you have not seen before, with an emphasis on realism.<br>To survive, you have a long way to go: transport goods, explore the territory, grow vegetables, craft various items, create cargo, mine ores.<br>For example, overdoing it with radiation drugs, the main character can get hallucinations. Also, do not underestimate lunar gravity, it can play into your hands or against you.<br>Great soundtrack, and the atmosphere of the game will help you relax a little. A lot of surprises await you.<br><br><strong>Are you ready for a challenge in a new unusual universe?</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> FEATURES: <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br>\u2022 Survival on the Moon.<br>\u2022 Ability to control the lunar rover.<br>\u2022 Ability to control the drone.<br>\u2022 Craft.<br>\u2022 Explore the skill tree.<br>\u2022 Exploration of a large open area.<br>\u2022 Realistic graphics.<br>\u2022 Mining.<br>\u2022 Excellent soundtrack.<br>\u2022 Atmosphere.<br>\u2022 Transportation of goods.<br>\u2022 The force of gravity.<br>\u2022 Scoring.</h2></h2>",
    "short_description": "The Moon Relax is a realistic exploration and survival game set in a large open world on the Moon.",
